$bog_merchquarium_help $mol_list
	rows /
		<= Lead $mol_paragraph
			title @ \A quick tour for the catalog author. Buyers never see this page.
		<= Section*about
		<= Section*look
		<= Section*products
		<= Section*tags
		<= Section*import
		<= Section*preview
		<= Section*share
		<= Section*access
	Section* $mol_view
		sub /
			<= Section_icon* $mol_view
				sub /
					<= icon* $mol_icon
			<= Section_body* $mol_list
				rows /
					<= Section_title* $mol_paragraph
						title <= section_title* \
					<= Section_text* $mol_text
						text <= section_text* \
	Icon_about $mol_icon_send_outline
	Icon_look $mol_icon_palette_outline
	Icon_products $mol_icon_storefront_outline
	Icon_tags $mol_icon_tag_multiple
	Icon_import $mol_icon_robot_outline
	Icon_preview $mol_icon_eye_outline
	Icon_share $mol_icon_share_variant
	Icon_access $mol_icon_account_multiple
	about_title @ \How it works
	about_text @ \
		\A buyer browses the catalog, puts items into the cart and sends you a request in direct messages. The request has the list, the total and a link to the order. Payment and delivery are discussed in the chat as usual.
	look_title @ \Look and contacts
	look_text @ \
		\The gear in the header opens the settings: title, avatar, header and page backgrounds, color theme.
		\
		\In **Sales** set where requests go: a Telegram @nick or a VK link. Other socials become icons in the header.
	products_title @ \Products
	products_text @ \
		\**Add product** creates an empty card, fill it in place. Photos are uploaded with the button under the card, several per product.
		\
		\**In stock** can be ordered. **Sold out** stays in the catalog with a badge, and a buyer can tell you they wait for a reprint. **Hidden** is visible only to you.
		\
		\A deleted product comes back with the button in its place or with Ctrl+Z.
	tags_title @ \Merch kinds and fandoms
	tags_text @ \
		\They become filters and #tags on cards. A buyer taps a tag and sees everything from that fandom.
	import_title @ \Many products at once
	import_text @ \
		\Settings → **Bulk import**. Copy the prompt and send it to any AI chat: it asks about your merch and replies with JSON. Paste the JSON back and the products appear at once, with kinds, fandoms and socials. Add photos afterwards.
		\
		\JSON with only kinds or only fandoms works too.
	preview_title @ \How buyers see it
	preview_text @ \
		\The eye button shows the catalog the way a buyer sees it: no hidden products, sold out ones at the end, no editing. Press it again to get back.
	share_title @ \Link and orders
	share_text @ \
		\Take the catalog link from the address bar and put it where your buyers are: profile, pinned post, channel description.
		\
		\The link in a request opens the order with prices and the total, handy for checking.
	access_title @ \Co-author and search
	access_text @ \
		\In **Access** you can let another person edit the catalog by their account id.
		\
		\**Show in search engines** decides whether the catalog gets into Yandex and Google.
